# --- Bytecode / build caches ---
__pycache__
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.egg-info
.venv/
venv/
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/.ruff_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache

# --- VCS / repo metadata — never ship into the build context ---
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github

# --- Runtime-generated / transient state ---
**/long_term_memory
**/local_vector_memory
**/.install.lock
**/.requirements_hash
**/dormouse
.pod_id
.welcome

# --- Local tooling / editor / agent state ---
.omo
.opencode
.vscode
.idea

# --- Secrets & env — keep out of the build context entirely ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- Docs & tests not required to build the image ---
docs
tests
README.md

# --- Container / build tooling files ---
Dockerfile
Dockerfile:*
compose.yml
Makefile
